  "body": "Built for family life and thoughtfully considered from the ground up, this exceptional Torbay home combines generous proportions, quality finishes and versatile spaces to create a residence that is both impressive and genuinely inviting.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, spacious open-plan living and dining enjoy excellent natural light and connect seamlessly to a sunny north-facing deck, creating an ideal setting for relaxed family living and entertaining. A separate lounge provides an additional retreat, while the downstairs ensuite bedroom offers flexibility for guests, extended family or teenagers.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four generous bedrooms and a second living area provide plenty of space for the whole family. The master suite is a private retreat with sea views, walk-in wardrobe and double-vanity ensuite, plus an adjoining room ideal as a study or home office.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in sought-after Torbay, you are close to Browns Bay Beach, Long Bay Regional Park, Albany Shopping Centre, Park & Ride and motorway connections. The home is also zoned for Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nA quality family home offering space, flexibility and lifestyle - ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\n***Photos Disclaimer: Photos contain AI-enhanced, for illustrative purposes only",
